D.bOh=new A.jw("Breaker off, then test","Before you touch any wire, switch its breaker OFF, then check with a voltage tester that the wire is dead. A switch on the wall is not enough.")
D.bO4=new A.jw("Lock out, tag out","On a real job you put a lock or a note on the panel so nobody switches the power back on while you work.")
D.bOo=new A.jw("Water and power","Water carries electricity. Near sinks, tubs and outdoors the outlets must be GFCI, and wet hands never touch wires.")
D.bO9=new A.jw("Eyes, ears, lungs","Safety glasses for drilling and cutting, ear protection for loud tools, and a mask when you sand drywall dust or cut tile.")
D.bOn=new A.jw("Shut the water off","Before you cut or loosen a pipe, close the main water valve and open a faucet to drain the line.")
